    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Path of the RNGesus\u00a0is a turn-based, item-focused strategy roguelike where you manipulate RNG to optimize item synergies and enemy actions in your favor.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Manipulate RNG</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every turn, reroll or freeze item conditions, effects and enemy actions in your favor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3792640/extras/f43259956f78768fe0a3ab630073d28c.poster.avif?t=1752094046\" width=576 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3792640/extras/f43259956f78768fe0a3ab630073d28c.webm?t=1752094046\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3792640/extras/f43259956f78768fe0a3ab630073d28c.mp4?t=1752094046\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Loot!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hoard many different items and game changing perks to create powerful builds and destroy your enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3792640/extras/7d46e141c3b90610eb4dc1f404dddb96.poster.avif?t=1752094046\" width=192 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3792640/extras/7d46e141c3b90610eb4dc1f404dddb96.webm?t=1752094046\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3792640/extras/7d46e141c3b90610eb4dc1f404dddb96.mp4?t=1752094046\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3792640/extras/be676eda970eeb9b8d6fad06f8610075.poster.avif?t=1752094046\" width=192 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3792640/extras/be676eda970eeb9b8d6fad06f8610075.webm?t=1752094046\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3792640/extras/be676eda970eeb9b8d6fad06f8610075.mp4?t=1752094046\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3792640/extras/ead25b6301bf13b52124d37356ae0304.poster.avif?t=1752094046\" width=192 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3792640/extras/ead25b6301bf13b52124d37356ae0304.webm?t=1752094046\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3792640/extras/ead25b6301bf13b52124d37356ae0304.mp4?t=1752094046\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Choose your path!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After each combat, pick the path that best fits your run from a selection of options.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3792640/extras/5ae125db2d83cdcaf17e66d7b9809e40.poster.avif?t=1752094046\" width=576 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3792640/extras/5ae125db2d83cdcaf17e66d7b9809e40.webm?t=1752094046\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3792640/extras/5ae125db2d83cdcaf17e66d7b9809e40.mp4?t=1752094046\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Path of the RNGesus\u00a0is a turn-based, item-focused strategy roguelike where you manipulate RNG to optimize item synergies and enemy actions in your favor.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Manipulate RNG</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every turn, reroll or freeze item conditions, effects and enemy actions in your favor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3792640/extras/f43259956f78768fe0a3ab630073d28c.poster.avif?t=1752094046\" width=576 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3792640/extras/f43259956f78768fe0a3ab630073d28c.webm?t=1752094046\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3792640/extras/f43259956f78768fe0a3ab630073d28c.mp4?t=1752094046\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Loot!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hoard many different items and game changing perks to create powerful builds and destroy your enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3792640/extras/7d46e141c3b90610eb4dc1f404dddb96.poster.avif?t=1752094046\" width=192 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3792640/extras/7d46e141c3b90610eb4dc1f404dddb96.webm?t=1752094046\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3792640/extras/7d46e141c3b90610eb4dc1f404dddb96.mp4?t=1752094046\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3792640/extras/be676eda970eeb9b8d6fad06f8610075.poster.avif?t=1752094046\" width=192 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3792640/extras/be676eda970eeb9b8d6fad06f8610075.webm?t=1752094046\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3792640/extras/be676eda970eeb9b8d6fad06f8610075.mp4?t=1752094046\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3792640/extras/ead25b6301bf13b52124d37356ae0304.poster.avif?t=1752094046\" width=192 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3792640/extras/ead25b6301bf13b52124d37356ae0304.webm?t=1752094046\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3792640/extras/ead25b6301bf13b52124d37356ae0304.mp4?t=1752094046\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Choose your path!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After each combat, pick the path that best fits your run from a selection of options.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3792640/extras/5ae125db2d83cdcaf17e66d7b9809e40.poster.avif?t=1752094046\" width=576 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3792640/extras/5ae125db2d83cdcaf17e66d7b9809e40.webm?t=1752094046\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3792640/extras/5ae125db2d83cdcaf17e66d7b9809e40.mp4?t=1752094046\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
